132 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 121 0 R/E(This month, THRILL brought the world of roller coasters to the Ville! At this event, passionate members of THRILL presented topics regarding a large range of topics regarding roller coasters. THRILL collaborated on this event with the J.B. Speed School of Engineering, utilizing their new Engineering Student Success & Research Building \(ESSRB\), and with the University of Louisville Honors program, who generously provided free food for all event presenters and attendees. This event was THRILL\220s biggest to date and had over 100 students, both inside Speed School and across other majors, attending in hopes of learning more about roller coasters.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

