140 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 121 0 R/E(Welcome to Industry Inversion, a student-led newsletter run by the Themed Rides Industry Leaders of Louisville \(THRILL@UofL\). Students with THRILL at the University of Louisville contribute articles on industry events, announcements, park reviews, engineering deep dives, and more. THRILL is a nonprofit registered student organization \(RSO\) at the University of Louisville focused on the amusement industry, roller coasters, engineering, and everything in between. )/Pg 10 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

