197 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 123 0 R/T(During CoasterVille, I hosted a booth about seasonal theme park haunt events such as Universal Studios\220 Halloween Horror Nights, Six Flags\220 Fright Fest, and Hersheypark\220s Dark Nights. These events take place starting in late August or mid-September and run until early November. At the center of these events are several different haunted houses and scare zones, each with their own theming. Theming is often based on pop culture horror icons, common fears and phobias, or folklore monsters. )/E(During CoasterVille, I hosted a booth about seasonal theme park haunt events such as Universal Studios\220 Halloween Horror Nights, Six Flags\220 Fright Fest, and Hersheypark\220s Dark Nights. These events take place starting in late August or mid-September and run until early November. At the center of these events are several different haunted houses and scare zones, each with their own theming. Theming is often based on pop culture horror icons, common fears and phobias, or folklore monsters. )/Pg 12 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

198 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 123 0 R/T(One of my favorite topics that I got to share with CoasterVille attendees was the art of scare acting and the considerations that designers and engineers take to keep them safe. Anyone can audition to be a scare actor, and since actors are primarily cast based on height, body type, and experience, the audition process is very simple. I asked three volunteers from each group to tell me their name, age, and height, spin slowly to give a full view of their body type, and then state their favorite scary movie. That is a very common audition structure, even for massively popular events. )/E(One of my favorite topics that I got to share with CoasterVille attendees was the art of scare acting and the considerations that designers and engineers take to keep them safe. Anyone can audition to be a scare actor, and since actors are primarily cast based on height, body type, and experience, the audition process is very simple. I asked three volunteers from each group to tell me their name, age, and height, spin slowly to give a full view of their body type, and then state their favorite scary movie. That is a very common audition structure, even for massively popular events. )/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

199 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 123 0 R/T(Several precautions are taken in the process of constructing haunted houses in order to keep these actors from getting hit by guests who can\220t control their fear reaction well. Actors will often perform scares from behind walls or screens, on top of stages, or within fenced off areas. Actors are also usually taught to perform their jump scare very quickly and remove themself as soon as they\220re finished. This can keep them from being the victim of a physically violent guest. These safeguards are not always foolproof though, especially for a roaming actor in a scare zone. More effective solutions for actor safety are still developing within the industry.)/E(Several precautions are taken in the process of constructing haunted houses in order to keep these actors from getting hit by guests who can\220t control their fear reaction well. Actors will often perform scares from behind walls or screens, on top of stages, or within fenced off areas. Actors are also usually taught to perform their jump scare very quickly and remove themself as soon as they\220re finished. This can keep them from being the victim of a physically violent guest. These safeguards are not always foolproof though, especially for a roaming actor in a scare zone. More effective solutions for actor safety are still developing within the industry.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

