227 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 124 0 R/T(At CoasterVille, I gave a presentation on coaster trains. It covered the different types of trains, the restraints that keep riders in their seats, and the safety mechanisms working behind the scenes. Those include ratchet and hydraulic locks, anti-rollback dogs on the lift hill, and sensors that confirm every restraint is locked before a train can leave the station. It was a lot of fun showing people just how many layers of protection go into a roller coaster, especially with all of the recent horrific events in the news. )/E(At CoasterVille, I gave a presentation on coaster trains. It covered the different types of trains, the restraints that keep riders in their seats, and the safety mechanisms working behind the scenes. Those include ratchet and hydraulic locks, anti-rollback dogs on the lift hill, and sensors that confirm every restraint is locked before a train can leave the station. It was a lot of fun showing people just how many layers of protection go into a roller coaster, especially with all of the recent horrific events in the news. )/Pg 13 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

228 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 124 0 R/T(That mattered to me because incidents at theme parks are actually really rare, and I wanted people to leave understanding that. When you see how many backups exist for the backups, it\220s a lot easier to feel safe on a ride. This topic was extremely important to me because I love roller coasters so much. These machines are built for riders\220 enjoyment, and I hate the idea that anyone would feel unsafe on them.)/E(That mattered to me because incidents at theme parks are actually really rare, and I wanted people to leave understanding that. When you see how many backups exist for the backups, it\220s a lot easier to feel safe on a ride. This topic was extremely important to me because I love roller coasters so much. These machines are built for riders\220 enjoyment, and I hate the idea that anyone would feel unsafe on them.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

