256 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 125 0 R/T(This month, THRILL had the honor of hosting guest speaker, Dennis Speigel. As the founder and CEO of International Theme Park Services \(ITPS\), Dennis has spent more than 50  years impacting on the attraction industry for the better. His career began at just 13 years old as a ticket taker at Coney Island in Cincinnati, Ohio, and eventually grew into a leadership role in the development and management of theme parks around the world. )/E(This month, THRILL had the honor of hosting guest speaker, Dennis Speigel. As the founder and CEO of International Theme Park Services \(ITPS\), Dennis has spent more than 50  years impacting on the attraction industry for the better. His career began at just 13 years old as a ticket taker at Coney Island in Cincinnati, Ohio, and eventually grew into a leadership role in the development and management of theme parks around the world. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

257 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 125 0 R/T(In 1983, Speigel founded the consulting firm ITPS. Over his career, Speigel has worked on more than 500 projects in over 55 countries and has contributed to the development and success of numerous attractions, including Kings Island and Kings Dominion. He has also served as chairman of the International Association of Amusement Parks and Attractions \(IAAPA\), one of the leading organizations in the global attractions industry. In recognition of his contributions, Dennis was inducted into the IAAPA Hall of Fame in 2022.)/E(In 1983, Speigel founded the consulting firm ITPS. Over his career, Speigel has worked on more than 500 projects in over 55 countries and has contributed to the development and success of numerous attractions, including Kings Island and Kings Dominion. He has also served as chairman of the International Association of Amusement Parks and Attractions \(IAAPA\), one of the leading organizations in the global attractions industry. In recognition of his contributions, Dennis was inducted into the IAAPA Hall of Fame in 2022.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

258 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 125 0 R/T(During his visit, THRILL members had the opportunity to hear about Speigel\220s extensive industry experience and learn more about how to have a career in the theme park industry. He advised that the best place to get started is simply wherever you can. He noted that something as small as taking tickets, like he did, could be the start to a successful career in this industry.  )/E(During his visit, THRILL members had the opportunity to hear about Speigel\220s extensive industry experience and learn more about how to have a career in the theme park industry. He advised that the best place to get started is simply wherever you can. He noted that something as small as taking tickets, like he did, could be the start to a successful career in this industry.  )/Pg 14 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

259 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 125 0 R/T(We are incredibly grateful to Dennis Speigel for taking the time to speak with THRILL and share his knowledge with our members. His experiences offered us insight into how everything within a theme park, from the hospitality to the rides themselves, is intertwined and work together to create the experience that guests have when they visit a park. From all the members at THRILL, we want to thank Dennis Speigel for being part of our journey as a student organization and for showing our members a real industry leader who is continuing to shape the entertainment industry today!)/E(We are incredibly grateful to Dennis Speigel for taking the time to speak with THRILL and share his knowledge with our members. His experiences offered us insight into how everything within a theme park, from the hospitality to the rides themselves, is intertwined and work together to create the experience that guests have when they visit a park. From all the members at THRILL, we want to thank Dennis Speigel for being part of our journey as a student organization and for showing our members a real industry leader who is continuing to shape the entertainment industry today!)/Pg 14 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

