274 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 126 0 R/T(My name is AJ Wyckoff, and I am vice president of THRILL. My love for the industry dates back to 2018 when I went to Kings Island with my family and they took me on Mystic Timbers. The rest is history. I spent the rest of that summer I spent researching and looking up as many theme parks as I could, and I could not get enough of them. 3 years later, I got to go to Cedar Point with my family and from that day on I knew the combination of my love for math and roller coasters destined me to pursue mechanical engineering, which led me to the University of Louisville. I met Preston at Leadership Advantage, a pre-semester summer camp for incoming Speed School freshman, and he introduced this idea that would eventually become THRILL. )/E(My name is AJ Wyckoff, and I am vice president of THRILL. My love for the industry dates back to 2018 when I went to Kings Island with my family and they took me on Mystic Timbers. The rest is history. I spent the rest of that summer I spent researching and looking up as many theme parks as I could, and I could not get enough of them. 3 years later, I got to go to Cedar Point with my family and from that day on I knew the combination of my love for math and roller coasters destined me to pursue mechanical engineering, which led me to the University of Louisville. I met Preston at Leadership Advantage, a pre-semester summer camp for incoming Speed School freshman, and he introduced this idea that would eventually become THRILL. )/Pg 15 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

275 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 126 0 R/T(The best thing about THRILL is that it is such a young and new RSO which means the precedent hasn't been set. All officers and members of THRILL can be as ambitious as we please because we are paving our own tracks for this club, and the sky's the limit. My plans and goals for THRILL are to expand past just the engineering aspect of THRILL. I feel as of now that most of our members are engineers, which is fantastic, but there's so much more to the industry. There's marketing, sales, and management, which I believe there are students on campus who would benefit and love to be a part of those aspects of the industry. )/E(The best thing about THRILL is that it is such a young and new RSO which means the precedent hasn't been set. All officers and members of THRILL can be as ambitious as we please because we are paving our own tracks for this club, and the sky's the limit. My plans and goals for THRILL are to expand past just the engineering aspect of THRILL. I feel as of now that most of our members are engineers, which is fantastic, but there's so much more to the industry. There's marketing, sales, and management, which I believe there are students on campus who would benefit and love to be a part of those aspects of the industry. )/Pg 15 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

